  "attack_surface": "Bi-tight for all p\u22655 via gap path needs BOTH:\n  (A) mult(\u03bb\u2082)\u2265d;\n  (B) \u2016\u03ba\u2016_F\u00b2\u226496n  (\u21d4 \u2211M\u00b2\u2264Wick_hi).\nProp 15.96 proves the Wick\u2013\u03ba identities and the equivalence (B)\u21d4Wick, and C_diag\u226496n. Both (A) and (B) certified at p=3,5,7 ((B) eq only p=3). General (A)(B) OPEN. Alternates: 16N / H.",
  "verdict": "Prop 15.96 proves Wick\u2013\u03ba calculus on every conference Max+: \u2211M\u00b2=12n\u00b2\u221248n+\u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2 and \u2211M\u00b2\u2264Wick \u21d4 \u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2\u226496n; C_diag\u226496n algebraically. With mult\u2265d this closes gap for p\u22655 once \u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2\u226496n. Certified p=3,5,7. General mult and \u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2 bound OPEN. lim \u03b1_n OPEN.",
